OL,3,GNEWSAHalfords fined after employee
OL,4,Akilled during repair
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalfords has been fined #600,000 after
OL,7,Fan employee was killed by a vehicle
OL,8,Fwhile carrying out a roadside repair.
OL,10,FNiall Fawcett, from Talke,
OL,11,FStaffordshire, died on a slip road at
OL,12,Fjunction 7 of the M56 near Bowdon,
OL,13,FCheshire, on 2 August, 2024.
OL,15,FThe 21-year-old suffered fatal head
OL,16,Finjuries when the vehicle he had been
OL,17,Fworking on slipped from a hydraulic
OL,18,Flifting tool and landed on him.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
