OL,3,GNEWSAHalfords fined after employee
OL,4,Akilled during repair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Health and Safety Executive (HSE)
OL,7,Finvestigation found Halfords had failed
OL,8,Fto properly assess the risks of
OL,9,Freplacing a blown-out tyre on a
OL,10,Flow-profile truck.
